>Součástí realizace byla také optimalizace struktury a obsahu webu s ohledem na vyhledávače a lepší dohledatelnost služeb v oblasti CNC frézování, CNC soustružení, montážních prací a dodávek odlitků.</p>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "df10c08", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "konradt.cz", "link": {"url": "https://www.konradt.cz/", "is_external": "on", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "ww-btn--plain ww-btn--ext"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "46a788e", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "748e947", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-top", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "484d195", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "image", "settings": {"image": {"id": 29, "url": "https://wwwwww.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reference-monika-velickova-web.jpg", "alt": "Reference: web Monika Veličková", "source": "library"}, "image_size": "large", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-shot"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "97849ad", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<span class=\"ww-ref-hint\">Projeďte web ↓</span>", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-hintw"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "fa4b344", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-body", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "5eca87c", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Web · Reality Jeseníky", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-tag"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "f5e9c60", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Monika Veličková", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "23e5269", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Pro realitní makléřku Moniku Veličkovou jsme vytvořili nové webové stránky zaměřené na prezentaci nemovitostí a realitních služeb v Jeseníkách. Při realizaci jsme kladli důraz na moderní a osobitý design, přehlednou prezentaci nabízených nemovitostí a především na budování osobní značky, která staví na znalosti regionu, individuálním přístupu a zkušenostech s realitami i investicemi.</p>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "49ca26f", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "monikavelickova.cz", "link": {"url": "https://monikavelickova.cz/", "is_external": "on", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "ww-btn--plain ww-btn--ext"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "f1a533e", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "1dd2028", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-top", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "98e43ea", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "image", "settings": {"image": {"id": 27, "url": "https://wwwwww.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reference-brincil-web.jpg", "alt": "Reference: web Břinčil", "source": "library"}, "image_size": "large", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-shot"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "d713f55", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<span class=\"ww-ref-hint\">Projeďte web ↓</span>", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-hintw"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "b83f2b2", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-body", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "097c539", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Web · Technika a služby", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-tag"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "dd5a665", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Břinčil", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "e1557f8", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Při realizaci webu pro firmu Břinčil jsme kladli důraz na moderní a přehledný design, snadnou orientaci návštěvníků a kvalitní prezentaci společnosti i její techniky. Nový web zároveň slouží jako podpůrná prezentace hlavní společnosti Břinčil &amp; Míka s.r.o., pro kterou jsme v minulosti rovněž realizovali kompletní online prezentaci.</p>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "7ebf267", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "brincil.cz", "link": {"url": "https://brincil.cz/", "is_external": "on", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "ww-btn--plain ww-btn--ext"}, "elements": []}]}]}]}, {"id": "47f6227", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-row ww-refs-more ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "88cc1ae", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Další weby, e-shopy a kampaně najdete v portfoliu Yesmark.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-muted"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "4fd96cc", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "Všechny reference", "link": {"url": "https://yesmark.eu/reference/?utm_source=wwwwww.cz&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=wwwwww_reference&utm_content=homepage_all", "is_external": "on", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "ww-btn--dark ww-btn--ext"}, "elements": []}]}]}]}, {"id": "b34a946", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-sec ww-dark", "html_tag": "section", "_element_id": "cenik"}, "elements": [{"id": "6f660e0", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ww-price", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "ab97ab5", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-price-card ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "a040d1d", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Cena", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-eyebrow"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "e0fe0e3", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "<small>Web pro jazykovou školu a lektora</small>od 9 900 Kč", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-price-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "9fea26d", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Konečná cena záleží na počtu stránek, funkcích (rezervace, e-shop, jazyky) a grafice. Nabídku vám připravíme zdarma.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-muted"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "c5663d9", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-row", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "8b61cbb", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "Chci cenovou nabídku", "link": {"url": "#poptavka", "is_external": "", "nofollow": ""}}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "948f29a", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "89c9773", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Časté otázky – web pro jazykovou školu a lektora", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "ww-h2s"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "bfa2bd9", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "toggle", "settings": {"faq_schema": "yes", "tabs": [{"_id": "5908091", "tab_title": "Jde na web dát rozřazovací test?", "tab_content": "<p>Ano – jednoduchý online test doporučí úroveň a rovnou nabídne vhodný kurz.</p>"}, {"_id": "78ecc97", "tab_title": "Má lektor jednotlivec potřebu webu?", "tab_content": "<p>Ano – i jednoduchý web s nabídkou, cenou a rezervací přivede studenty z okolí i online.</p>"}, {"_id": "c41141d", "tab_title": "Jak dlouho trvá vytvoření webu – jazyková škola / lektor?", "tab_content": "<p>Jednodušší web bývá hotový za 2–4 týdny, rozsáhlejší s rezervacemi nebo e-shopem za 4–8 týdnů. Přesný harmonogram dostanete v nabídce.</p>"}, {"_id": "582fdba", "tab_title": "Budu si web upravovat sám?", "tab_content": "<p>Ano. Stavíme na WordPressu a Elementoru – texty, ceník, fotky i nové stránky změníte sami a ukážeme vám, jak na to.</p>"}, {"_id": "cd42e2d", "tab_title": "Tvoříte weby jen v Jeseníku?", "tab_content": "<p>Sídlíme v Jeseníku, ale weby tvoříme pro klienty z celé České republiky. Spolupráce běží online, místní rádi potkáme osobně.</p>"}], "_css_classes": "ww-faq"}, "elements": []}]}]}]}, {"id": "6566360", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-sec ww-light", "html_tag": "section", "_element_id": "poptavka"}, "elements": [{"id": "98daa42", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "ddd8004", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-head ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "03904d5", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "95f17c6", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Poptávka", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-eyebrow"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "85ce7d7", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Chcete web pro jazykovou školu a lektora?", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "ww-h2"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "d6bab3a", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"edito